<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view>
        <view class="title">{{weekStart}} 所在周</view>
        <view class="muted" wx:if="{{teamName}}">团队：{{teamName}}</view>
        <view class="muted" wx:if="{{resolving}}">正在获取团队信息…</view>
      </view>
      <picker
        wx:if="{{teams.length > 1}}"
        range="{{teams}}"
        range-key="teamName"
        bindchange="onTeamChange"
      >
        <view class="tag">切换团队</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="notice notice-danger" wx:if="{{noAccess}}">
      当前账号没有排班管理员权限，请先联系部署方授权后再导入。
    </view>
    <view class="subtitle">同一批次只支持一个团队、一个自然周；混入不同周的图请拆成两个任务。</view>

    <button class="btn" style="margin-top: 24rpx;" bindtap="chooseFromChat" disabled="{{uploading || noAccess}}">
      从微信聊天选图
    </button>
    <button class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 16rpx;" bindtap="chooseFromAlbum" disabled="{{uploading || noAccess}}">
      从相册选图
    </button>
    <view class="muted" style="margin-top: 16rpx; text-align: center;">
      每批 {{maxCount}} 张以内，单图不超过 {{maxSizeText}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:if="{{files.length > 0}}">
    <view class="row-between">
      <view class="title">已选 {{files.length}} 张</view>
      <view class="muted">顺序影响识别分页</view>
    </view>

    <view class="file list-item" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path">
      <view class="row-between">
        <view class="file-main">
          <view class="file-name">{{index + 1}}. {{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="muted">{{item.sizeText}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="file-actions" wx:if="{{!uploading}}">
          <text class="mini" bindtap="moveUp" data-index="{{index}}">上移</text>
          <text class="mini" bindtap="moveDown" data-index="{{index}}">下移</text>
          <text class="mini danger" bindtap="removeFile" data-index="{{index}}">移除</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="btn"
      style="margin-top: 24rpx;"
      bindtap="onSubmit"
      loading="{{uploading}}"
      disabled="{{uploading}}"
    >
      上传并提交识别
    </button>
    <view class="muted" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 12rpx;" wx:if="{{progressText}}">
      {{progressText}}
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:else>
    <view class="empty">还未选择图片</view>
  </view>

  <view class="muted" style="padding: 0 12rpx;">
    原图仅管理员可见，默认最多保留 7 天；已发布排班不受影响。取消选图不会创建任务。
  </view>
</view>
